  "releaseNotes": "🚨 Breaking Changes\n\nfix: prevent delegation to inexact user mappings by @latonz in #2421\n\n🚀 Features\n\nperf: optimize order-preserving stack mappings by @latonz in #2423\n\nperf: pre-size transformed set mappings by @latonz in #2424\n\nperf: pre-size transformed queue mappings by @latonz in #2425\n\n🐛 Bug Fixes\n\nfix: prevent delegation to inexact user mappings by @latonz in #2421\n\nfix: compare enum values across different underlying types in by-value enum mappings by @trejjam in #2465\n\nfix: avoid building external mapping bodies by @latonz in #2474\n\nFull Changelog: https://github.com/riok/mapperly/compare/v5.0.0-next.11...v5.0.0-next.12",
